# Security headers for the app's static files (docs/plan.md §1.35). Cloudflare's static assets
# read this file; the API's responses get theirs from apps/api/src/security-headers.ts.
# The CSP allows only this origin, plus Sentry's ingest for error reports. Inline style attributes
# (React's `style`) need 'unsafe-inline' for styles; scripts stay 'self' only. data: and blob: images
# and fonts are what the feedback screenshot (modern-screenshot) draws with.
# v0.12 bankfeed (docs/plan.md §1.52): Plaid Link, the narrowest we know works: its one script by
# full path, its frames from cdn.plaid.com, and Plaid's API hosts for what the script calls from
# the page (production and sandbox; the file is the same for staging and production). No inline
# scripts. Verify in Plaid's sandbox with an OAuth bank (packages/connectors/src/bankfeed/NOTES.md).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.plaid.com/link/v2/stable/link-initialize.js; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://*.ingest.de.sentry.io https://production.plaid.com https://sandbox.plaid.com; frame-src 'self' https://cdn.plaid.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# docs/audit-plan.md 4.4: the build's files under /assets/ carry a hash of their contents in their
# names, so one is never asked for twice. Cloudflare applies every rule a path matches, so these
# files keep the security headers of /* above; only Cache-Control is added (Cloudflare's default
# for static assets, `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, is replaced). Files at the root
# (index.html, the favicons) are not hashed and keep the default.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# v0.14 W4-D: Google Sheets' picking page only (docs/plan.md §1.52), loaded as a document of its own.
# It replaces the policy above with the same one plus Google's two scripts (the Picker's loader on
# apis.google.com, and Google Identity Services' client, which gets the Picker its token in a
# pop-up), the Picker's frame on docs.google.com and Identity Services' frame and calls under
# accounts.google.com/gsi/. The pop-up must be able to answer this page: same-origin-allow-popups.
# Every other path keeps the policy above. What Google needs exactly is in
# packages/connectors/src/gsheets/NOTES.md, to verify.
/connections/gsheets/pick
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://apis.google.com https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/ https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://*.ingest.de.sentry.io; frame-src 'self' https://docs.google.com https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

# v0.14 W4-A: WhatsApp through Meta's Embedded Signup page only (docs/plan.md §1.57), loaded as a
# document of its own. It replaces the policy above with the same one plus Meta's JS SDK by its
# full path (the SDK loads its own code from that path), Meta's frames on www/web.facebook.com and
# staticxx.facebook.com (the SDK's cross-domain channel), and Graph's API for the SDK's own calls.
# Meta's window is a pop-up that answers this page (`postMessage`, checked by exact origin):
# same-origin-allow-popups. Every other path keeps the policy above. What Meta's SDK needs exactly
# is in packages/connectors/src/whatsapp_meta/NOTES.md, to verify.
/connections/whatsapp_meta/signup
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/sdk.js; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://graph.facebook.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://*.ingest.de.sentry.io; frame-src 'self' https://www.facebook.com https://web.facebook.com https://staticxx.facebook.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
